        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Swing your grappling hook in zero gravity to hack into Senator Redd's VPN</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore in Zero Gravity</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can jump in any direction and swing across the level - your grappling hook can take you anywhere! Even if you spin into the abyss gravity will bring you back. <u>This game plays like flying in a dream feels.</u></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Get Around Security Systems</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level has Auditors, which scan the level, try to knock you off balance or <strong><i>kill you on sight</i></strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A timer slowly counts down, and you have only 60 seconds to complete each level!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After you unlock all portals, access the heart and heal the level</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Install Elite Hardware Upgrades</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From vision that allows you to see through walls, to instant grappling hook lock, to being able to grab onto the air itself, <strong>Lightbody has 17 different upgrades</strong> that make each run unique!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Make Senator Redd Pay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Senator Redd's corruption, and his alliance with The Will has gone on long enough. <strong>It ends here.</strong> You know everything is there on his hard drive, now you just have to get through his VPN security, and make him <strong>PAY</strong>...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Swing your grappling hook in zero gravity to hack into Senator Redd's VPN</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore in Zero Gravity</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can jump in any direction and swing across the level - your grappling hook can take you anywhere! Even if you spin into the abyss gravity will bring you back. <u>This game plays like flying in a dream feels.</u></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Get Around Security Systems</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level has Auditors, which scan the level, try to knock you off balance or <strong><i>kill you on sight</i></strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A timer slowly counts down, and you have only 60 seconds to complete each level!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After you unlock all portals, access the heart and heal the level</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Install Elite Hardware Upgrades</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From vision that allows you to see through walls, to instant grappling hook lock, to being able to grab onto the air itself, <strong>Lightbody has 17 different upgrades</strong> that make each run unique!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Make Senator Redd Pay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Senator Redd's corruption, and his alliance with The Will has gone on long enough. <strong>It ends here.</strong> You know everything is there on his hard drive, now you just have to get through his VPN security, and make him <strong>PAY</strong>...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
